body:

A seven-part introduction to Euclidean constructions using compass
and straightedge, by Dr. David E. Joyce.

1. [Euclidean constructions](compass1/)
2. [Reduction to circular constructions](compass2/)
3. [Summary of inversion](compass3/)
4. [Stereographic projection](compass4/)
5. [Invert a point in a circle](compass5/)
6. [Find the center of a circle](compass6/)
7. [Involutory quandles](compass7/)
